# ============================================================================
# .gitattributes for the pf_bridge coordination repo
# ============================================================================
# WHY: this repo carries evidence whose BYTES are the evidence (hash manifests,
# tsv fact packs, receipts). If git rewrites line endings on checkout, a fresh
# clone on another machine gets different bytes than the machine that produced
# the file, and every content-sha pin silently disagrees. That is the same
# class of bug as FINDINGS R12 (gate not reproducible from git).
#
# Default is therefore NO conversion. The overrides below match the main repo's
# .gitattributes exactly for the file types both repos share.

* -text

*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sql  text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
